(a) the applicant is a company limited by shares;
(b) the applicant is demutualised;
(c) the applicant, its directors and shareholders who hold or intend to hold shares, are
fit and proper persons, as specified in these regulations;
(d) the applicant satisfies the conditions relating to ownership and governance
structure, as specified in these regulations;
