3. Definitions
1) In these regulations, unless the context otherwise requires, the terms defined herein
shall bear the meanings as assigned to them below and their cognate expressions and
variations shall be construed accordingly: -
(i). "Act" means the International Financial Services Centres Authority Act,
(ii). "Ancillary Services" means those services which, directly or indirectly, aid,
help or assist in making arrangements for carrying on any of the financial
services listed in sub-clauses (i) to (xi) of clause (e) of sub- section (1) of
section 3 of the Act;
(iii). "Authority" means the International Financial Services Centres Authority
established under sub-section (1) of section 4 of the Act;
(iv). "Group Entities" includes an arrangement involving two or more entities
related to each other through any of the following relationships:
(a) parent- subsidiary (as per Ind-AS 110/AS 21);
(b) joint venture (as per Ind-AS 28/AS 27);
(v). (c) associate (as per Ind-AS 28/AS 23);
(d) common brand name;
(viii). (e) investment in equity shares/capital contribution of 20 per cent and above;
(x). (f) part of a network;
